### get index names
GET http://localhost:9200/_cat/indices/entities?v&h=index&s=index

### get entities by name
GET http://localhost:9200/entities/_search?pretty
content-type: application/json

{
  "query": {
    "match": {
      "entity_name": "The Apotheca Sh"
    }
  },
  "_source": ["entity_name"],
  "size": 10
}

### analyze edge_ngram tokenization using the index's own analyzer
POST http://localhost:9200/entities/_analyze?pretty
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "analyzer": "edge_ngram_analyzer",
  "text": "The Apothecary Sho"
}

### get index settings and mappings
GET http://localhost:9200/entities?pretty

### list indices with size and doc count
GET http://localhost:9200/_cat/indices/entities?v&h=index,store.size,docs.count&s=index




